{"brief": "B4", "model": "openai/gpt-6-luna", "i": 2, "finish": "stop", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f4f0e7\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Morrow & Finch is an independent poetry press for poems that stay with you.\">\n  <title>Morrow &amp; Finch \u2014 Poems to keep close</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --paper: #f4f0e7;\n      --ink: #1f2824;\n      --muted: #686c61;\n      --green: #354b3d;\n      --orange: #d36b48;\n      --line: rgba(31, 40, 36, .18);\n      --serif: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      --sans: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: var(--paper);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    a { color: inherit; }\n\n    .wrap {\n      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 64px));\n      margin-inline: auto;\n    }\n\n    .topline {\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: .16em;\n      padding: 11px 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      align-items: center;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      min-height: 82px;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      align-items: center;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      align-items: center;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: var(--paper);\n      display: inline-flex;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 19px;\n      height: 38px;\n      justify-content: center;\n      letter-spacing: -.08em;\n      padding-right: 3px;\n      width: 38px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-name {\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 19px;\n      letter-spacing: -.03em;\n    }\n\n    nav {\n      align-items: center;\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 34px;\n    }\n\n    nav a {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      transition: color .2s ease;\n    }\n\n    nav a:hover { color: var(--orange); }\n\n    nav .nav-cta {\n      border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n      padding: 11px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      align-items: center;\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 8%;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;\n      min-height: 590px;\n      padding: 74px 0 84px;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      align-items: center;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      display: flex;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      gap: 11px;\n      letter-spacing: .17em;\n      margin: 0 0 26px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow::before {\n      background: var(--orange);\n      content: \"\";\n      height: 1px;\n      width: 27px;\n    }\n\n    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: clamp(56px, 7.2vw, 94px);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.065em;\n      line-height: .94;\n      margin-bottom: 27px;\n      max-width: 600px;\n    }\n\n    h1 em {\n      color: var(--green);\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .hero-copy {\n      color: #555b52;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 19px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      margin-bottom: 31px;\n      max-width: 390px;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      align-items: center;\n      background: var(--green);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      display: inline-flex;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      gap: 22px;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      padding: 16px 19px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease;\n    }\n\n    .button:hover {\n      background: #25372b;\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n    }\n\n    .button span { font-size: 17px; line-height: 10px; }\n\n    .hero-note {\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\n      margin: 26px 0 0;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .book-stage {\n      align-items: center;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 50%, rgba(217, 200, 168, .55), transparent 67%),\n        linear-gradient(135deg, #e8e2d5, #eee9de);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 430px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .book-stage::before,\n    .book-stage::after {\n      border: 1px solid rgba(53, 75, 61, .18);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      content: \"\";\n      height: 370px;\n      position: absolute;\n      right: -85px;\n      top: -190px;\n      width: 370px;\n    }\n\n    .book-stage::after {\n      height: 270px;\n      left: -105px;\n      right: auto;\n      top: auto;\n      bottom: -175px;\n      width: 270px;\n    }\n\n    .book {\n      background: #263b3b;\n      box-shadow: 18px 20px 32px rgba(25, 34, 28, .22), 3px 0 0 #192b2b;\n      color: #f4eee1;\n      height: 350px;\n      padding: 29px 28px;\n      position: relative;\n      transform: rotate(-4deg);\n      width: 245px;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .book::before {\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,.25), transparent 12%, rgba(255,255,255,.08) 13%, transparent 18%);\n      content: \"\";\n      inset: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      position: absolute;\n    }\n\n    .book-kicker {\n      font-size: 8px;\n      letter-spacing: .2em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .book-title {\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 35px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.055em;\n      line-height: .91;\n      margin: 25px 0 7px;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .book-subtitle {\n      color: #d9c9a9;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      margin: 0;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .cover-art {\n      height: 132px;\n      left: 0;\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 136px;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .book-author {\n      bottom: 26px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      left: 28px;\n      letter-spacing: .16em;\n      position: absolute;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .stage-caption {\n      bottom: 20px;\n      color: #62685d;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      letter-spacing: .13em;\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 22px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .release {\n      background: var(--green);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      padding: 82px 0;\n    }\n\n    .release-inner {\n      align-items: center;\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 11%;\n      grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr;\n    }\n\n    .release-label {\n      color: #c7cbbd;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: .17em;\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .release h2 {\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: clamp(39px, 5vw, 61px);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.05em;\n      line-height: .98;\n      margin-bottom: 21px;\n    }\n\n    .release-author {\n      color: #d0a084;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .release-description {\n      border-left: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 231, .28);\n      color: #e0e1d7;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      padding: 4px 0 4px 35px;\n    }\n\n    .release-description p { margin-bottom: 23px; }\n\n    .text-link {\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 231, .6);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      display: inline-block;\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\n      padding-bottom: 6px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .about {\n      align-items: center;\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 10%;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      padding: 100px 0;\n    }\n\n    .about-art {\n      align-items: center;\n      background: #e8e2d5;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 300px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .about-art::before {\n      border: 1px solid rgba(53, 75, 61, .32);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      content: \"\";\n      height: 260px;\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 260px;\n    }\n\n    .about-art::after {\n      background: var(--orange);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      content: \"\";\n      height: 10px;\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .orbit {\n      border: 1px solid rgba(53, 75, 61, .24);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      height: 190px;\n      position: absolute;\n      transform: rotate(-34deg);\n      width: 330px;\n    }\n\n    .about-mark {\n      color: var(--green);\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 86px;\n      letter-spacing: -.1em;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .about-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n\n    .about-copy h2 {\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: clamp(38px, 4.2vw, 54px);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.055em;\n      line-height: 1.02;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .about-copy > p:last-child {\n      color: #5c6158;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n      margin: 0;\n      max-width: 430px;\n    }\n\n    .newsletter {\n      align-items: center;\n      background: #e7e1d4;\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 30px;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      padding: 49px 54px;\n    }\n\n    .newsletter h2 {\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 34px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.04em;\n      margin-bottom: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .newsletter p {\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .signup {\n      display: flex;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\n    }\n\n    .signup input {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      flex: 1;\n      font: 13px var(--sans);\n      min-width: 0;\n      outline: none;\n      padding: 14px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .signup input::placeholder { color: #77796f; }\n\n    .signup button {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: 0;\n      color: var(--green);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font: 10px var(--sans);\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\n      padding: 0 4px 0 14px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    footer {\n      align-items: center;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      display: flex;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      padding: 29px 0 34px;\n    }\n\n    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }\n    .footer-links a { text-decoration: none; }\n    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }\n\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\n      .wrap { width: min(100% - 40px, 560px); }\n      .topline { font-size: 8px; }\n      header { min-height: 70px; }\n      nav { gap: 16px; }\n      nav a { font-size: 11px; }\n      nav a:nth-child(2) { display: none; }\n      nav .nav-cta { padding: 9px 11px; }\n      .brand-name { font-size: 17px; }\n      .hero {\n        gap: 42px;\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        padding: 62px 0 58px;\n      }\n      h1 { font-size: clamp(58px, 14vw, 82px); }\n      .hero-copy { font-size: 17px; }\n      .book-stage { min-height: 390px; }\n      .release { padding: 62px 0; }\n      .release-inner { gap: 28px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .release-description { font-size: 17px; padding-left: 20px; }\n      .about { gap: 42px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 66px 0; }\n      .about-art { min-height: 250px; }\n      .newsletter { gap: 25px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 32px 25px; }\n      footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 17px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 390px) {\n      .wrap { width: calc(100% - 32px); }\n      .brand { gap: 8px; }\n      .brand-mark { height: 33px; width: 33px; }\n      .brand-name { font-size: 15px; }\n      nav { gap: 10px; }\n      nav a { font-size: 10px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"topline\">Independent poetry \u00b7 Carefully made in the Pacific Northwest</div>\n\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <header>\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Morrow and Finch home\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">m&f</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">Morrow &amp; Finch</span>\n      </a>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n        <a href=\"#books\">Books</a>\n        <a href=\"#about\">Our press</a>\n        <a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"#newsletter\">Stay in the know <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n      <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">A small press for lasting words</p>\n          <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Poems to<br>keep <em>close.</em></h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-copy\">We publish thoughtful poetry for the curious, the tender-hearted, and everyone still learning how to look.</p>\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"#books\">Find your next read <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span></a>\n          <p class=\"hero-note\">Made slowly. Read anywhere.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"book-stage\" aria-label=\"Featured book, The Shape of Leaving by Mara Bell\">\n          <div class=\"book\">\n            <div class=\"book-kicker\">Morrow &amp; Finch Poetry</div>\n            <h2 class=\"book-title\">The Shape<br>of Leaving</h2>\n            <p class=\"book-subtitle\">poems for the in-between</p>\n            <svg class=\"cover-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 245 132\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Abstract sunset and botanical line art\">\n              <circle cx=\"127\" cy=\"63\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#cf7654\"/>\n              <path d=\"M0 103 C48 91 78 104 121 96 C165 87 199 96 245 80 L245 132 L0 132Z\" fill=\"#d6c4a3\"/>\n              <path d=\"M23 131 C55 104 66 75 66 37 M66 86 C48 76 43 60 45 49 M66 74 C84 66 91 52 90 40 M66 99 C83 91 97 91 109 97\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8dfca\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M66 59 C56 52 53 44 54 36 M66 71 C75 64 79 56 79 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8dfca\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <path d=\"M177 132 C170 107 175 86 191 70 C202 60 211 47 211 31 M188 83 C174 77 169 67 169 57 M193 75 C207 73 216 65 221 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#324847\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"book-author\">Mara Bell</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"stage-caption\">Spring / 01</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"release\" id=\"books\" aria-labelledby=\"release-title\">\n    <div class=\"wrap release-inner\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"release-label\">Our latest release</p>\n        <h2 id=\"release-title\">The Shape<br>of Leaving</h2>\n        <p class=\"release-author\">by Mara Bell</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"release-description\">\n        <p>A luminous collection about the places we leave, the people we carry, and the small, surprising ways we find our way back to ourselves.</p>\n        <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#newsletter\">Discover the collection&nbsp; \u2197</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap about\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\">\n    <div class=\"about-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"orbit\"></span>\n      <span class=\"about-mark\">m&amp;f</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"about-copy\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">A little about us</p>\n      <h2 id=\"about-title\">Good poems make room.</h2>\n      <p>Morrow &amp; Finch is an independent poetry press with a soft spot for fresh voices and beautiful books. We believe a poem can be a window, a hand to hold, or a place to begin again.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap newsletter\" id=\"newsletter\" aria-labelledby=\"newsletter-title\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 id=\"newsletter-title\">A note from the press.</h2>\n      <p>New books, reading lists, and occasional dispatches. No noise, just good words.</p>\n    </div>\n    <form class=\"signup\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n      <label for=\"email\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Your email address</label>\n      <input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" required>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Sign me up&nbsp; \u2192</button>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <footer>\n      <span>\u00a9 2025 Morrow &amp; Finch Press</span>\n      <div class=\"footer-links\">\n        <a href=\"#about\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"#books\">Books</a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:hello@morrowandfinch.example\">Get in touch</a>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <style>\n    .visually-hidden {\n      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n      clip-path: inset(50%);\n      height: 1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: absolute;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      width: 1px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</body>\n</html>"}